[{"title":"秋","author":"张天赋","text":"造化栽培久，秋光逼草堂。\n天风无禁约，吹散广寒香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3571,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬","author":"张天赋","text":"道体茫茫也，观书徒五车。\n好将男子眼，看破雪中花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3572,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为毛旸谷进士题风烟雪月梅卷四首 其一 风梅","author":"张天赋","text":"铁干摇不动，封姨莫妒猜。\n刚到无花际，从容带笑开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3573,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为毛旸谷进士题风烟雪月梅卷四首 其二 烟梅","author":"张天赋","text":"天地眷琼葩，琼枝护练花。\n爱渠清白好，不肯嫁繁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3574,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为毛旸谷进士题风烟雪月梅卷四首 其三 雪梅","author":"张天赋","text":"六出混五出，皑皑迥无异。\n消融让结实，调羹功及第。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3575,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为毛旸谷进士题风烟雪月梅卷四首 其四 月梅","author":"张天赋","text":"墙角吐暗香，清白居上品。\n世人高着眼，梢头好光景。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3576,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范攸县出示都宪顾东桥游南岳次韵","author":"张天赋","text":"吾道在天地，动静旋相生。\n禅家自灰槁，空负源头清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3577,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北旋因思家君竹山翁","author":"张天赋","text":"书债何时了，君恩欲去酬。\n白云隔万里，翘首叶冈头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3578,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"抵清河县过张仲河登岸游观","author":"张天赋","text":"开花多异样，山鸟不知名。\n万里清河客，来游故郡城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3579,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀","author":"张天赋","text":"天地何生我，青山绿水中。\n昂然不飞去，诗酒醉春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3580,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与诸父兄会於寺醉中命题一门和气","author":"张天赋","text":"一派清河远，金枝玉叶新。\n春风袅袅煖，吹动座中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3581,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京行抵筠竹怀亲","author":"张天赋","text":"筠竹竹无异，举头山不同。\n瞻云深拜祝，护我白头翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3582,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒陈草堂","author":"张天赋","text":"笑入草堂来，庭花喜开遍。\n春风吹我怀，如见草堂面。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3583,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑十一月朔桂花方开十一日喜得第五男","author":"张天赋","text":"迟迟烂熳开，贞元会合培。\n喜与一阳复，香从天上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3584,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诣德宏叔馆","author":"张天赋","text":"幽谷居虽陋，春风道却尊。\n门墙桃李树，生意满乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3585,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登和平鹰吊岭","author":"张天赋","text":"鹰吊横绦路，春风动客衣。\n浩歌登绝顶，回首万山低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3586,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜抵和平宿环溪寺","author":"张天赋","text":"路远嗟来晚，山僧梦已痴。\n敲门惊破胆，撩乱佛菩提。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3587,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自慰","author":"张天赋","text":"禹门风浪小，鱼跃未腾霄。\n转海脩鳞甲，翻身即巨鳌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3588,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自慎","author":"张天赋","text":"乾坤多路头，行行莫差却。\n世人不慎初，千里始知错。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3589,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与东涧","author":"张天赋","text":"当年同苦乐，今日各东西。\n白发相看老，江云怅望低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3590,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯愈泣杖","author":"张天赋","text":"杖头知母力，衰弱不如前。\n母杖何能久，伤心涕泪涟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3591,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李密乞养","author":"张天赋","text":"祖母恩深厚，陈情乞养终。\n祇闻儿养母，孙亦与儿同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3592,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽独别号","author":"张天赋","text":"结庐南山下，经岁少人来。\n云罩庭阶静，呼童归不开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3593,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事有感","author":"张天赋","text":"莫羡东邻富，堪嗟西舍贫。\n家居一块土，天定两般人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3594,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东阿县望东山","author":"张天赋","text":"多时南北地，今复过东山。\n未遂登临愿，终身负恧颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3595,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛子岭飞泉","author":"张天赋","text":"溪源何处发，流水下瑶天。\n未到庐山下，先观瀑布泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3596,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次东洲韵","author":"张天赋","text":"汨罗屈原苦，首阳伯夷饥。\n我欲戒孤愤，不与借阶梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3597,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉当道檄娄采皇木於济阳石霜寺","author":"张天赋","text":"绿水青山里，禅关锁白云。\n胡麻流碧涧，瑶草吐奇芬。\n古柏枯无用，长沙虚有闻。\n若非亲目击，何以报慇勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3598,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和古城龚太守壁间原次阳明先生韵","author":"张天赋","text":"世路随长短，浮云弄阴晴。\n纲常九鼎重，富贵一毛轻。\n幻梦迷蕉鹿，愁城破酒兵。\n客窗浑不寐，欹枕听鸡行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3599,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新建吴思斋诗来次韵答之","author":"张天赋","text":"诗书今日债，灯火十年劳。\n自我希贤圣，谁人擅俊髦。\n寒生门外雪，煖拥座中袍。\n会得丸中趣，粗心没半毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3600,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟夏与诸公臬司较艺浏庠士次壁间韵","author":"张天赋","text":"日光摇短砌，树色霭前村。\n哲人世已邈，流风今尚存。\n密云迷楚岫，明月照柴门。\n芹拂芸香合，高斟带酒吞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3601,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又次壁间韵","author":"张天赋","text":"水止波光寂，林深鸟语新。\n地同天作泰，人与物皆春。\n风月无今古，江山相主宾。\n夜清金错落，彩凤舞庭筠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3602,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹰吊岭望和平县兼怀翠屏张掌教","author":"张天赋","text":"冲破云间路，孤城入望中。\n岚光盈聚落，烟火半堤封。\n远近畸零野，高低大小峰。\n铁潭何处月，清浸广寒宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3603,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州怀宗伯两浙运判廷璧公先任邳州经历","author":"张天赋","text":"邳州官似水，两浙水如官。\n见水虽云易，如公亦是难。\n祇交家国富，不念子孙寒。\n今过邳州地，思公借水看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3604,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞鸿阁一绝纪之","author":"张天赋","text":"一区容膝所，五夜读书堂。\n退食惭尸位，瞻云叹客乡。\n未嫌邻矮屋，且喜向朝阳。\n丙午春王正，疏狂纪叶冈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3605,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊仪真次早发舟宿扬州","author":"张天赋","text":"风解仪真缆，江天度晓关。\n莺喉歌夏调，花雨带春寒。\n景物随人胜，诗肠逐酒宽。\n扬州天不夜，灯火灿鳌山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3606,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕梁洪谒关尉祠","author":"张天赋","text":"汉唐家国旧，豪杰威灵新。\n庙食垂千古，碑铭集众论。\n孤高遗墨竹，光彩照凌烟。\n瞻拜嗟来晚，心香妙合神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3607,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过东平州","author":"张天赋","text":"汉家嫌七国，善乐此东平。\n陵墓多冠盖，亭楼尽缙绅。\n状元联父子，形势壮山城。\n笑醒诗人眼，歌狂写我情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3608,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓南都夜怀室人","author":"张天赋","text":"两地参商梦，天涯又一秋。\n连年人怨别，屈指自知羞。\n闻笛愁欹枕，看花懒下楼。\n瞳瞳方寸月，终夜叶冈头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3609,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜同鹊山和山北上","author":"张天赋","text":"鹊报先春信，和声叶濩英。\n叶冈垂绿荫，山色转新晴。\n连辔誇同志，排云了夙盟。\n中原渺如许，谁认是祥麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3610,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄揭阳业师黄先生","author":"张天赋","text":"桃花门墙下，春风化育深。\n百年山斗望，千里圣贤心。\n世路有先后，纲常无古今。\n天涯倍惆怅，聊尔达新吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3611,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"县君吴玉溪公来请脩志醉中一律谢其使者","author":"张天赋","text":"睡熟松阴下，风敲午梦清。\n日高花影董，茶薄鹤声停。\n天地难逃懒，纷华念亦轻。\n飘然回首去，何以写新情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3612,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兴宁八景","author":"张天赋","text":"龙母钟灵厚，温泉发派长。\n横舟浮古渡，夜气现神光。\n老蚌涵秋月，灵鸡唱晓窗。\n路通丞相辙，风动墨池香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3613,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹山八景","author":"张天赋","text":"翠色逼危岑，红颜醉晚林。\n台高垂钓古，井冽发源深。\n流水古今运，白云舒捲心。\n吾伊声彻夜，师友日侵寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3614,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔艇","author":"张天赋","text":"天地无拘管，潇然一钓蓑。\n夜波清浸月，春草绿铺沙。\n白酒供鱼酌，空山傲世歌。\n屠龙无捉摸，须捷柰君何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3615,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游温泉","author":"张天赋","text":"子丑初开辟，钟来有此泉。\n万年春不断，一脉气长偏。\n地里因人胜，源流与道绵。\n试观天意思，融液自浑全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3616,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中有感","author":"张天赋","text":"乾坤有正气，尽付男子俦。\n声翔天外去，志向水中流。\n久已弄丸子，今犹戏绣毬。\n功名浑閒事，谈笑便封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3617,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭中避暑即事","author":"张天赋","text":"兀坐虚亭上，天风喜送凉。\n槐阴摇嫩绿，荷蕊吐新香。\n鱼戏波中藻，莺啼柳外簧。\n南山浑不语，相对若相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3618,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子夏初携二儿府试湆溪早发","author":"张天赋","text":"山色分东曙，征衣袭晓寒。\n苗生初展绿，梅熟尚留酸。\n旅思凭诗遣，岩花带笑看。\n天风如有约，九万助鹏抟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3619,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬州望如皋百里许怀邑侯仇讷斋先生","author":"张天赋","text":"仰止摩诃上，齐昌旧令公。\n棠阴犹带绿，燕麦独摇风。\n见水思清操，看花想醉容。\n好怀歌不尽，何处达征鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3620,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽陈竹邻员外先生","author":"张天赋","text":"粤南秋榜首，京国地官郎。\n宦署冰霜冷，门墙桃李芳。\n高名何所负，久要不相忘。\n箕尾冥冥去，悲君哭断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3621,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滕王阁下发舟","author":"张天赋","text":"舟发自滕王，天风助舰樯。\n眼前光景别，脚板路头长。\n彭蠡通东海，匡庐接太荒。\n白云回首远，举目是天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3622,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮安阻雨宿星子坝夜怀空人","author":"张天赋","text":"万里淮安客，孤舟强作诗。\n夜深霜露冷，天近斗星移。\n细酒甜如蜜，黄河浊似泥。\n梅花深处里，应是梦交时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3623,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五言古风","author":"张天赋","text":"天命有定在，人心无了期。\n春桃与秋菊，舒芬各平时。\n人心出处问，徒尔劳心机。\n朔风吹我怀，肝胆天应知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3624,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和节推吴先生山行即事","author":"张天赋","text":"枫陛传胪罢，鹅城拜命行。\n月沉一潭碧，风拂万家清。\n有脚阳春布，无知草木灵。\n鲰生承教育，仰荷不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3625,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送见峰先生回江西","author":"张天赋","text":"两袖春风暖，乘云度越山。\n几宵灯火语，千古圣贤关。\n遽别添新恨，长歌翚醉颜。\n苍生翘首望，莫久蜀江閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3626,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其一 竹山牧犊","author":"张天赋","text":"不往桃林放，淇园别样春。\n翠阴风有约，嫩绿地无尘。\n短笛由歌曲，疏篁对主宾。\n倒骑归去也，儿女笑相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3627,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其二 古寺寒泉","author":"张天赋","text":"兜率浑閒事，天然显地灵。\n一泓冰解冻，千古圣同清。\n磨墨题新句，辞官濯旧缨。\n我曾三载读，对此学惺惺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3628,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其三 地接神光","author":"张天赋","text":"秀峤钟灵异，叶冈脉络承。\n窗含五夜气，天假一篝灯。\n漏尽钟初动，云迷酒未醒。\n翰林香不断，吹过竹山亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3629,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其四 门朝丞相","author":"张天赋","text":"岑接千年秀，门当一岭青。\n地经前代相，天作大家屏。\n轮辙邈无迹，冠裳彷有形。\n高山动仰止，从此继芳声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3630,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其五 池沼鸢鱼","author":"张天赋","text":"一鉴方塘晓，天机云自然。\n羽鳞昭上下，道体是浑全。\n物物一太极，纷纷同本原。\n凭栏人不语，悟入几玄玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3631,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其六 水亭风月","author":"张天赋","text":"四面澄澄水，中心兀兀亭。\n虚明浑似我，吹照总忘情。\n爽气清诗骨，祥光映画屏。\n好怀天不禁，何处问登瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3632,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其七 茂林松竹","author":"张天赋","text":"卜宅诗书里，遮天松竹林。\n大夫操劲节，君子抱虚心。\n巢搆千年鹤，风摇十里阴。\n幽人避繁暑，扫石卧长吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3633,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题八景 其八 小圃山花","author":"张天赋","text":"地里殊无别，风光迥不同。\n巉岩谁作伴，烂熳自成丛。\n色艳欺图画，香飘落酒钟。\n乾坤都在此，何必问东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3634,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因王脩之邀饮和山岩二首刻一","author":"张天赋","text":"几夜竹山梦，东岩有主人。\n尺书随眼入，匹马破云行。\n杯酒同泉溜，歌声杂鸟鸣。\n座中秋色好，爽气可人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3635,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题何节妇","author":"张天赋","text":"霜冷黄花瘦，帘垂白月光。\n寸心浑铁石，两手是纲常。\n不负天生我，何惭女嫁郎。\n愧非银管客，聊此为揄扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3636,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧桃春鸟","author":"张天赋","text":"洞里乾坤别，春风灼灼花。\n轻烟笼绛粉，嫩绿衬丹霞。\n坞外传音远，稍头弄影斜。\n一团天意思，收拾大方家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3637,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五更瞻云祝寿","author":"张天赋","text":"游人千里外，风雨五更寒。\n父子经秋别，恩情两地关。\n瞻云心似火，祝寿愿如山。\n膝下无申达，徒怀一寸丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3638,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简王柳塘诗","author":"张天赋","text":"我老君亦老，相知老更真。\n百年今过半，明岁又重新。\n落落冈头景，融融柳眼青。\n橘中天不限，同笑烂柯人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3639,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登高","author":"张天赋","text":"笑侣陟危岑，天风拂我襟。\n仰瞻红日近，俯瞰北溟深。\n白发心偏壮，黄花酒满斟。\n明年当此日，谁抱伯牙琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3640,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王丽竹别号","author":"张天赋","text":"天易象苍筤，卫诗咏淇澳。\n矫矫龙凤姿，清标脱尘俗。\n长稍拂青云，疏枝筛白玉。\n劲节凌秋霜，雄风震空谷。\n夜气满山隈，看看生意足。\n平地一声雷，头角崭崭绿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3641,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入陈家坊","author":"张天赋","text":"东乡浏阳胜，最胜陈家坊。\n乔木风霜古，灵源世泽长。\n一洲仙献掌，百堵锦成行。\n牧笛兼渔笛，山光接水光。\n衣冠誇出色，桂籍世联芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3642,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浏阳太和铺次苏寨村壁间韵","author":"张天赋","text":"田家春起早，鸡唱启柴扉。\n扫石临流饭，携锄带月归。\n晚山岚气寂，秋雨稻花肥。\n常恐天䬝作，飘飖结实微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3643,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静轩别号","author":"张天赋","text":"兀坐虚窗下，悠然太古情。\n物交何有感，天听寂无声。\n月照梧桐白，风传杨柳清。\n此时临此景，此念更惺惺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3644,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]